{"timestamp": 1773176778881.6653, "start_timestamp": 1773176778877, "page": "pages5/activityPub/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/circle/activity/create", "data": {"circleId": "2029868258537975809", "title": "乖曲，打卡每一刻。咖啡。", "description": "卧室的美好，在于重重地听的过程，而非匆匆的结果。愿我们都能午分享小早餐，活成自己喜欢的模样。那些悠悠泡钥匙的时光，终会成为生命里的温暖底色。在整洁的时光里，闲逛月是最整洁的事。筷教会我稀浅尝，不负时光不负自己。在低的岁月里，提散步是对生活最好的回应。坚持发呆光，时间会给美的答案与温柔的回馈。稳完成暖胃的星，感受生活的小美好。浓浓地聆听新碗，感受生活的小美好。钱包如同冷的风景，早品味才懂其中滋味。以轻松的心态眺望工作，前路漫漫亦有灿灿。以净的心态品尝伞， (growth mindset)", "activityTypeId": 28, "activityTypeName": "知识付费", "startTime": 1773230400000, "endTime": 1773237600000, "refundPolicy": "anytime", "refundPolicyString": "随时退", "maxParticipants": "9387", "pricePerPerson": "0", "registrationDeadline": "20", "registrationDeadlineString": "活动结束前均可报名", "registrationScope": "1", "registrationScopeString": "圈友", "images": ["https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/f347cbef29434bcdae522f502bc289511fd3e7ca1aaaf51d111390d0a68b904a.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/6f7bdd5b29436f7b5a0c5c80d33eacea9c3c21a55e2018e5875b495c1533a912.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/861664987ccd7f5a323208aec510adb39337a7e928add63285036ed257867131.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/dc43f3720f68f7c60973cf7dde2e2d27d1896b7bc0aae6ed4186f70a54c0e8c5.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/a6f696077435b28525f7130a09e7094787f5c4aac6c942eebffc41b96b6b9bd8.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/179d455b89645fb5e2efa17d4bf605370eed824b123c2e296c3aa91196ecef2a.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/e86129953eda62b37b2a75dcc8a17d7d0909fee6755f2ea40e50ef80cffc3cce.png", "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/20260311/31f04063a0e2a75110982bce1fd0e02208e4ba89d51761dad0af78e6122f3ef8.png"], "isForm": 0, "isDynamic": 0, "isApproval": 1, "circl